    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-970272b0-3dfe-4cdc-90aa-a9fe53b7dd8d" n="1026" facs="#m-fd749e94-6910-4d13-8332-5c6498a2d1c6" /><div xml:id="m-c0c94de9-da1f-42b1-8f83-cf268c8bae96">
            <lg xml:id="m-0d1ef80b-624d-4ecb-8dff-ec9d49a019b3">
              <l xml:id="m-c5627121-569c-4dca-9475-73f136b4487a" facs="#m-42aec163-0061-47aa-9632-a8548f2e284d" label="ambiguous">840</l><l xml:id="m-13259f94-abf6-4ac1-bc5f-b00bb77b3897" facs="#m-e5d54ae5-aa67-4ea9-acdb-d7c86fffbbd0" label="text-like">The Greater and Lesser Litanies.</l><l xml:id="m-05db932b-98b6-45c7-917a-0a41407dafc8" facs="#m-2f01ae21-155a-4f53-9e07-362e79148349" label="lyrics-like">V. Mitte éis Dómine auxilium de sáncto. K. Et de Sion tuére éos.</l><l xml:id="m-203c0f0b-dc57-4a0d-9f18-404fa43ca0cb" facs="#m-08f9cfd5-6000-4cfa-ab81-d258d17d67b5" label="lyrics-like">V. Dómine exáudi oratiónem méam. H. Et clámor méus ad te véniat.</l><l xml:id="m-be157150-6226-42a2-8803-ff4cd95037dc" facs="#m-a66820d8-5d95-444a-8a4a-2e338b530a9d" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobiscum. K. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-aa39309a-4959-4a6e-8c1d-6b71d339d645" facs="#m-a5f314a2-daf2-4b75-8234-2e35da2c49ea" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-8c33f86e-f789-4172-bead-f08e946553ff" facs="#m-9e73470e-b07b-4d36-8646-5276640f1e7c" label="ambiguous">Prayers.</l><l xml:id="m-fdf2fce0-2520-4987-b00d-c80f7024e823" facs="#m-3f6d7801-de97-456e-9b9c-d7467948c7a4" label="lyrics-like">Eus, cui próprium est miserér</l><l xml:id="m-3b0e96b4-197c-4c32-b1ce-115b691f8e3c" facs="#m-0772a0be-05c4-442c-b265-5777e1034bea" label="lyrics-like">I semper et párcere:  súscipe</l><l xml:id="m-d00e172a-e313-4123-b5b0-cc43495dc522" facs="#m-217de765-6826-4955-a354-2f3928400cf2" label="lyrics-like">deprecatiónem nostram; ut nos, e</l><l xml:id="m-36005fb0-16cd-41f8-abff-b4d599fe1ac7" facs="#m-2b6f77b1-aa05-4c34-88f5-fc65041f220c" label="lyrics-like">omnes fámulos tuos, quos delictó.</l><l xml:id="m-55674980-b074-4556-b2bb-54f75b07aaa1" facs="#m-8e9f4188-c4c1-4f6f-9e4c-6d6fc86b7824" label="lyrics-like">rum caténa constríngit, * miserátio</l><l xml:id="m-3ddc920c-7895-4af9-8e6a-1a3a2e9ca4da" facs="#m-dbc8eb86-575a-4f16-94bf-35119afe34f3" label="lyrics-like">tuno niotátis cloméntor obsélzzat</l><l xml:id="m-bebe669f-c54f-460c-bc4c-b9419f5ef14b" facs="#m-d64decbe-16cf-4c12-9880-f12a90cc01e6" label="ambiguous">Iilum adhuc i carne reti¬</l><l xml:id="m-1676eb33-3b20-4435-8a2b-3cd887780eef" facs="#m-82bca3fa-bd58-437c-896e-f66199786634" label="lyrics-like">futúrum iam exútos cór¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf1bd380-cb18-49d0-a127-1856ed6b95cd" facs="#m-00573e3c-b5b2-41c8-a334-72bddae48975" label="lyrics-like">cépit,intercedéntibus</l><l xml:id="m-0bead68e-baa9-46b8-b33a-45e8b410e81b" facs="#m-612df6d5-ae76-4099-8ba7-39f27e08bf07" label="lyrics-like">Sanctis tuis, pietátis tuae</l><l xml:id="m-3c9feaa7-0b24-4213-8aef-4ef1dd9eb047" facs="#m-a8ca9342-57c9-4bf7-866a-6f6186f4e053" label="lyrics-like">ómnium delictórum suó¬</l><l xml:id="m-83b109a4-444e-4077-99fc-c5ade62a1343" facs="#m-83873ec1-849c-4def-b1ea-aaf128186929" label="lyrics-like">D cta consma, et justa sunt ope- rum vensam consequántur. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0fcc4589-cf8b-45a0-9509-cfe64ba1f2b7" facs="#m-a0605a2b-9704-409c-a892-45e2ecb45f10" label="ambiguous">ra: ! da servis tuis illam, quam</l><l xml:id="m-6d54bf48-a560-42b0-b4b2-7a5f5a2ef162" facs="#m-5bfbd049-0c25-4073-8a50-fba38a8e3dd8" label="ambiguous">minum nostrum Jesum Christum</l><l xml:id="m-311d828d-e887-447a-b81f-db2c874e1a7a" facs="#m-75552f1b-6288-40b8-9b4a-9b5696855a5d" label="ambiguous">mundus dare non potest, pacem;"ut</l><l xml:id="m-e770dc78-69f3-47b4-bfea-77cba4e5a694" facs="#m-dbf7fce9-d302-47d1-8777-6231dfdc0727" label="lyrics-like">Fílium tuum: t qui tecum vivit et</l><l xml:id="m-bd27d591-72db-4bfd-87fd-83ea22b08e61" facs="#m-b3ddb514-1f12-4f94-a261-4da673689496" label="lyrics-like">regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti</l><l xml:id="m-e19a7d2b-6bf6-4f76-af54-be664ddb2523" facs="#m-3815b288-8d6f-4da6-a993-485889df258f" label="lyrics-like">et corda nostra mandátis tuis dédita,</l><l xml:id="m-6b22cc8c-ac68-44a3-869d-6fb71831b0e6" facs="#m-a1cd4790-400c-43cb-acf3-bb4c2a9acbdf" label="lyrics-like">et hóstium subláta formídine, tém-Deus, * per ómnia saécula saeculó¬</l><l xml:id="m-44b5ac7b-29be-439d-99d5-f0815cb8f793" facs="#m-1d7fbfe2-126e-4f35-9fbc-4656635f5779" label="lyrics-like">pora sint tua protectióne tranquílla.  rum. K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-6481d5b8-dbef-466f-a88d-9d2f502f1e0d" facs="#m-9860d424-ca5e-446a-b9fa-222401d9965c" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobíscum. R. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-bfe72721-d12e-42b3-916d-03693b45c38e" facs="#m-652ac4f8-2415-4ae6-ad8c-1a948c1bbaab" label="lyrics-like">V. Exáudiat nos omnípotens et miséricors Dóminus. K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-bcfec8ad-8139-4dd1-a6c4-04502882829b" facs="#m-aaf68e87-85fb-4979-8b84-ae15a8558a48" label="lyrics-like">v. Et fidélium ánimae per misericórdiam Déi requiéscant in páce.</l><l xml:id="m-42e3ec5f-08f5-4211-9dc8-afac01cd01aa" facs="#m-8dd95ed0-9279-4eeb-b2a8-bb1cfd7943eb" label="ambiguous">K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-e44ff648-286f-4b24-9ec5-3540de504ace" facs="#m-0a7f8a8d-00ee-4762-a025-e033cc63520c" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-86f3af41-d26d-4c1b-a406-06e52bf08311" facs="#m-48a47412-a7e2-4873-85f0-48208e12a7d0" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-7685b8ab-0778-4970-b355-c6eabab492a2" facs="#m-b4331746-5191-4400-abd5-89ab536609bd" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-66ccd1eb-1e1e-4f64-92e5-4fba8ca00ba0" facs="#m-7af7d632-c0b2-49fe-8cfc-7e0809525a5e" label="ambiguous">U</l><l xml:id="m-d6836842-de88-4582-acdb-01f9ab521453" facs="#m-a2b8c5f2-5abb-4690-b5f0-faba58ede2e3" label="lyrics-like">X-audí-vit * de témplo sáncto sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-3f4f848f-6690-4565-b1e0-b76473c89cc1" facs="#m-b1ecd8f2-b72b-4d78-8312-ebb1e0ab8007" label="lyrics-like">vó-cen.</l><l xml:id="m-8a231e42-e0fa-44f4-9674-ef0a49506298" facs="#m-3174129a-42cd-4225-8027-db41d8047a62" label="ambiguous">O</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>